                <span id="ship"> </span>
                <span class="heading3">Shipping queries</span>
                <br />
                <span class="questions">How long does shipping take?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        When you crave a banana we know how important it is to be able to eat one as soon as possible. We know how it feels to not be able to enjoy a perfect banana right away when your tummy craves it. <br />
                        That is why we try to deliver our bananas as soon as possible. Depending on where you live and what type of banana you order. You can have your banana as soon as possible.
                        Our team is always on improving shipping time so you can literally be one click away from the perfect banana. <br />
                        Normal shipping can take anywhere up to 1-9 business days depending on amount, type, availability and delivery country. <br />
                        If your bananas wouldn't be delivered after 9 business days there is a chance that something happened to the order. Don't wait to @Html.ActionLink("contact us", "Contact", "home", new { area = "" }, new { @class = "link-in-text" }). We will help you to get your perfect banana and offer a compensation for the wait. <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <span class="questions">Do you ship to my area/country?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        Bananas should be accessible anywhere. <br />
                        No one should have to settle for the lesser just because their country does not exist on the shipping list. <br />
                        Whilst we try to ship to every country on the map and make Peely accessible for anyone. If you're unsure what countries we ship to check out at our checkout page the “country” options under shipping. <br />
                        Whilst we try to ship to most countries so everyone can enjoy a perfect banana. Some countries are nearly impossible to ship to. After deep consideration and a lot of research it is to our deepest sorrow to say that shipping to North Korea won't be available on our website. <br />
                        Different conflicts in countries may also result in a temporary unavailability for shipping to that specific country. <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <span id="pack"> </span>
                <span class="heading3">Packing</span>
                <br />
                <span class="questions">How are the bananas packaged to prevent damage?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        Our bananas are packaged in a very careful manner. <br />
                        Our workers make sure to package the bananas in a very careful way to avoid damage.
                        Whilst shipping we also avoid bumpy roads and to curvy ways to make sure bananas stay fresh. <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <span id="del"> </span>
                <span class="heading3">Delivery queries</span>
                <br />
                <span class="questions">Do you offer same-day or next-day delivery?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        Frustration is the word that comes to mind when you want something really bad but can't have it. Desperation is the next word that comes to mind when you are ready to do anything to receive that item… We understand this. We know how bad it can get when you want a specific banana so much but can't have… It is difficult in situations like these to maintain your feelings… <br />
                        At other companies they exploit this feeling and use it against us. With a fee that comes with same-day shipping or even a monthly subscription to gain the same-day shipping advantage.
                        At Peely we offer same-day shipping to almost every product for an increased shipping price.
                        You don't have to worry anymore. No more frustration. If you order before 2pm MST you can receive your parcel the same day if it qualifies the requirements. You can read more about this at check out.  <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <span class="questions">Can I schedule a specific delivery date for my order?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        Yes, @Html.ActionLink("contact us", "Contact", "home", new { area = "" }, new { @class = "link-in-text" }) for more information and choose a specific time. <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <span class="questions">Can I change my delivery address after placing an order?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        Yes, @Html.ActionLink("contact us", "Contact", "home", new { area = "" }, new { @class = "link-in-text" }) with the new address and the change will be possible. <br />
                        Delivery time might change. <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <span class="questions">Is there a minimum order amount to qualify for free delivery?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        We don't offer free shipping at our website.<br />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <span id="ret"> </span>
                <span class="heading3">Returns</span>
                <br />
                <span class="questions">How do you handle returns if bananas arrive damaged or overripe?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        If your banana came overripe or damaged take a picture of it and @Html.ActionLink("mail it", "Contact", "home", new { area = "" }, new { @class = "link-in-text" }) to us and the order number. After the complaint and return request has been approved we will immediately send new bananas. <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <span class="questions">What steps should I take if I'm unsatisfied with the bananas upon delivery?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        If you are unsatisfied with your bananas. We are deeply sorry. On our website you have 4 days to request a refund. If you would like one @Html.ActionLink("contact us", "Contact", "home", new { area = "" }, new { @class = "link-in-text" }) as soon as possible and our team will discuss if a refund will be possible. <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
