                <span id="price"> </span>
                <span class="heading3">Pricing</span>
                <br />
                <span class="questions">What are the prices for bananas, and do they vary by type or ripeness?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        Our banana prices are set to match the request and the popularity of the product. <br />
                        We try to make our bananas as accessible and affordable as we can so everyone can afford a good banana. <br />
                        However, depending on the type, request and popularity the prices will vary. <br />
                        A good banana begins with it being affordable. It should take a significant amount of money from our customers.<br />
                        That is why we work hard everyday to make sure our prices are as low as they can get.
                        The quality of the bananas however does not change. Every banana is expected to have the same high quality no matter the price. <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <span class="questions">Do you offer any discounts or special pricing for seniors, students, or families?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        Today to our deepest regret we do not offer special pricing for seniors, students and families. <br />
                        We know that some groups have a difficult time affording a good banana. <br />
                        But today at our digital shop we do not offer special discounts or pricings. <br />
                        However, at our physical store it is possible to get a discount if you are a senior or student. <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
                <span class="questions">Do you have a subscription option for regular banana deliveries?</span>
                <br />
                <div class="infotextbox">
                    <span class="infotext">
                        Currently we do not offer any subscriptions. <br />
                    </span>
                </div>
